# CODEOWNERS - gosplan-env
#
# Everything in this repository is reviewed by the lead. The paths listed below the catch-all are
# not extra reviewers: they are called out because they are the CONTRACT rule 1 and rule 2 FROZEN
# SURFACES, and a diff that touches one of them is a different kind of change from a diff that
# does not.
#
#   Rule 1  FROZEN SPEC.  spec/spec.py is provisional (v0) until gate G1 and frozen (v1)
#           thereafter. After v1, only the LEAD may change it, and only with a spec/CHANGELOG.md
#           entry (version, reason, affected work orders). No other session edits spec/spec.py.
#
#   Rule 2  FROZEN TESTS. tests/unit, tests/behavioural and tests/golden are read-only for
#           implementers. If a test looks wrong, file an AMBIGUITY REPORT; do not edit it, do not
#           skip it, do not special-case the implementation to pass it.
#
# An implementer PR that changes any path below is rejected without review. The correct action on
# noticing a problem in one of them is an ambiguity report (CONTRACT rule 3), never an edit.

*                       @Xocas12

# --- CONTRACT rule 1: the frozen interface -----------------------------------------------------
/spec/                  @Xocas12

# --- CONTRACT rule 2: the frozen test surface --------------------------------------------------
# Golden files are generated from ref/gen_golden.py and are never hand-edited; regenerating them
# is a LEAD act that requires a spec/CHANGELOG.md entry (WO-013).
#
# ONE CARVE-OUT: tests/unit/test_contract_guard.py is the test for the CI guard, not for the
# environment, and is not part of the frozen surface rule 2 protects (scripts/README.md,
# 'The rule-2 exemption'; CONTRIBUTING.md section 6). Whoever edits scripts/contract_guard.py
# edits it. The guard skips it structurally (FROZEN_TEST_NON_FROZEN_PATHS), so it needs no
# .github/FROZEN_TEST_EXEMPTION entry - a standing entry there would be a permanently
# disabled rule. That file stays the mechanism for temporary LEAD edits to genuinely frozen
# tests; never CONTRACT_ALLOW_FROZEN_TESTS=1 in a workflow. Every other file under the three
# directories below is frozen, with no exception.
/tests/unit/            @Xocas12
/tests/behavioural/     @Xocas12
/tests/golden/          @Xocas12

# --- The binding text and the authorisation system ---------------------------------------------
# CONTRACT.md is PLAN §9 reproduced verbatim. workorders/ is where a file gets an owning card at
# all: editing a card silently changes what some future session is allowed to do (CONTRACT
# rule 12), so cards are amended by the lead, in the open, before the card is picked up.
/CONTRACT.md            @Xocas12
/workorders/            @Xocas12

# --- Also lead-owned, for the same reason ------------------------------------------------------
# ref/ is the test oracle behind the golden matrix; tests/acceptance/ holds the gate experiments,
# which are never run by an implementer session (CONTRACT rule 13).
/ref/                   @Xocas12
/tests/acceptance/      @Xocas12
